      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's much better, thanks. It feels a lot more cohesive now.\n\nJust one quick sanity check though—I know the data shows Engineering at 25% and I don't want to get caught off guard if someone looks at the raw spreadsheet later. Are you sure saying it's a \"passing pattern\" or \"seasonal turnover\" is an accurate way to describe it based on the data you have? I just want to make sure we aren't being too loose with the facts if the CFO asks for specifics.",
